<title>CANADA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT CANADIAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT CANADIAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-08-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Canadian Open</p>
<p>tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix numbers denotes</p>
<p>seedings):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>3-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat 7-Todd Martin (U.S.)</p>
<p>4-6 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat 4-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 6-0</p>
<p>6-3</p>
</text>
